# Title: File Download via CertOC.EXE
# ID: 70ad0861-d1fe-491c-a45f-fa48148a300d
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-05-16
# Tags: attack.command-and-control, attack.t1105
# Description: Detects when a user downloads a file by using CertOC.exe
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (((process_exec="*-GetCACAPS*" AND process_exec="*http*")) AND ((process_path="*\\certoc.exe") OR (process_name="CertOC.exe")))
